  "Most companies score the same handful of signals: **problem scoping** (did you find out what matters before building?), **quantitative reasoning** (did numbers drive choices?), **trade-off awareness** (can you say what each choice costs?), **depth** (can you go below the boxes when asked?) and **communication** (could a teammate follow you?). The six-step method exists because it produces evidence for every one of those signals in order.",
