   "code": "// How many connections / workers do I need? (Little's Law)\nconst inFlight = (rps, latencyMs) => rps * (latencyMs / 1000);\nconsole.log(inFlight(2000, 50));  // 100  -> 10 per server across 10 servers\nconsole.log(inFlight(2000, 500)); // 1000 -> the pools are exhausted\n\n// How much does utilization hurt? (single-queue approximation)\nconst waitFactor = rho => rho / (1 - rho);\n[0.5, 0.7, 0.9, 0.95].forEach(r => console.log(r, waitFactor(r).toFixed(1) + 'x'));",
